  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BUILD PEACE IN THE HOLY LAND</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In recent days hundreds were wounded and killed in Gaza after heavy bombings; among these at least 15 children. These are just the most recent victims of a war that has been going on for too long now. Pro Terra Sancta Association has been committed to peace building in the Holy Land for years with social projects in support of the community in Gaza. Due to the recent events many are in danger now and need our support!</narrative>
  </description>
